# --- Recording / export outputs ---------------------------------------------
# The SDK writes recordings and exports where the caller asks it to. Never
# commit EEG recordings: they are health-adjacent participant data. Examples
# write to a temporary directory by default, but `--out` saves next to the
# example and these patterns keep that output out of git. Add fixtures
# deliberately with `git add -f` (see CONTRIBUTING.md).
examples/*.edf
examples/*.csv
examples/*.json
examples/*.fif
recordings/
*.edf
*.bdf
*.fif

